        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Inna\n- Products: Party Never Ends\n- Companies: Roton\n- Organizations: Ovidius University, Play & Win\n- Places: Mangalia, Neptun, Romania\n- Topics: music career, political science\n\nFacts:\n- Inna was born in Mangalia, Romania, and was raised in Neptun, Romania.\n- Inna studied political science at Ovidius University before pursuing a music career.\n- Inna met the Romanian trio Play & Win before pursuing her music career.\n- Party Never Ends is the third studio album by Romanian singer Inna.\n- Roton released Party Never Ends on 4 March 2013.",
